 - \`rlm(prompt, context=None) -> str\` — spawn a recursive sub-agent with a fresh context window and get its answer back as a Python string. The sub-agent sees only what you pass it. Use it to delegate chunk-level judgment over large data (summarize/extract/classify per chunk) without loading everything into your own context. Depth limit: ${info.maxDepth}.
